+# ❄️ PolarX
+
+**Integrated Polar Expedition Logistics & Asset Management System**
+
+Smart India Hackathon 2026 | Problem ID 26062  
+St. Xavier's Catholic College of Engineering, Nagercoil
+
+---
+
+## Stack
+
+| Layer    | Tech                                      |
+|----------|-------------------------------------------|
+| Frontend | React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router v6 |
+| Map      | React-Leaflet                             |
+| Charts   | Chart.js + react-chartjs-2                |
+| Realtime | Socket.io                                 |
+| Backend  | Node.js, Express                          |
+| ORM      | Sequelize (SQLite locally → PostgreSQL in prod) |
+| Auth     | JWT + bcryptjs                            |
+
+## Getting Started
+
+```bash
+# From repo root
+npm install        # installs root + client + server deps
+npm run dev        # starts both client (5173) and server (5000)
+```
+
+## Environment
+
+Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in values before running.
+
+## Structure
+
+```
+polarx-app/
+├── client/          # Vite + React frontend
+└── server/          # Express + Sequelize backend
+```
+
+## Switching to PostgreSQL
+
+Change `DB_DIALECT=sqlite` → `DB_DIALECT=postgres` in `.env` and supply `DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_NAME`, `DB_USER`, `DB_PASSWORD`. No model changes needed.
